# Errors

## INVALID_TLA_FORMAT

```text
[INVALID_TLA_FORMAT] Module format "iife" does not support top-level await. Use the "es" output format instead.
   ╭─[ entry.js:1:1 ]
   │
 1 │ await foo;
   │ ────┬────  
   │     ╰────── 
───╯

```

## INVALID_TLA_FORMAT

```text
[INVALID_TLA_FORMAT] Module format "iife" does not support top-level await. Use the "es" output format instead.
   ╭─[ entry.js:2:1 ]
   │
 2 │ for await (foo of bar) ;
   │ ────────────┬───────────  
